u}$ decay, a rare process that is a primary benchmark for the flavor sector of the Standard Model and the particle physics beyond it. This search relies on a decay-in-flight method where the decay is analyzed by studying the $\pi^+$ and its decay products. Based on a dataset of 12.9 inverse femtobarns collected in 2015, no $K^+ightarrow\pi^+
